布故與番君婚，以故長沙哀王使人紿布，偽與亡，誘走越，故信而隨之番陽。番陽人殺布茲鄉民田舍，遂滅黥布。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji091-027:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p017","start":106,"end":110,"surface":"長沙哀王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m017-0106","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予與用稱分存；常冠軍不作官名，欲為帝不作即帝位，稱病反楚死亡不補官爵終期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji091-021","person_id":"3lw_vex_s0b","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-091-qingbu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","rationale":"按本段明示姓名及局部敘事承接；布與兩王號按英布主線暫接。番君與長沙哀王分候選，所幸姬不與番君女合併；皋陶引古疑問不作祖先定論。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["長沙哀王"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p017","quote":"遂西，與上兵遇蘄西會甀。布兵精甚，上乃壁庸城，望布軍置陳如項籍軍，上惡之。與布相望見，遙謂布曰：「何苦而反？」布曰：「欲為帝耳。」上怒罵之，遂大戰。布軍敗走，渡淮，數止戰，不利，與百餘人走江南。布故與番君婚，以故長沙哀王使人紿布，偽與亡，誘走越，故信而隨之番陽。番陽人殺布茲鄉民田舍，遂滅黥布。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:p017","text":"遂西，與上兵遇蘄西會甀。布兵精甚，上乃壁庸城，望布軍置陳如項籍軍，上惡之。與布相望見，遙謂布曰：「何苦而反？」布曰：「欲為帝耳。」上怒罵之，遂大戰。布軍敗走，渡淮，數止戰，不利，與百餘人走江南。布故與番君婚，以故長沙哀王使人紿布，偽與亡，誘走越，故信而隨之番陽。番陽人殺布茲鄉民田舍，遂滅黥布。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m017-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"x7a_os4_5d8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m017-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"dsv_qg0_ete","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m017-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"x7a_os4_5d8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-091-qingbu:m017-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"dsv_qg0_ete","status":